==English==

===Noun===
'''waldmeister'''

# (''herb'') a [[perennial]] [[plant]], ''[[Galium odoratum]]'' or ''[[Asperula odorata]]'', with small white flowers; the leaves are used for flavouring [[wine]]s and [[liqueur]]s.

====Synonyms====
* [[waldmeister]], [[woodruff]], [[wuderove]]

